id: degenerate-dangling-dropin
category: degenerate
images: rs-oracle9
targets: rhel9
key: kernel.dmesg_restrict
xfail_issue: 
comment: a DANGLING SYMLINK (not the 99-slot, an ordinary numbered drop-in): --cat-config aborts (never shows 60-after.conf's content, exits 1), while the real applier SILENTLY skips it entirely (no 'Parsing' line at all, no error, exits 0) and continues to 60-after.conf. Distinct from the .conf-directory case: here the applier does not even log the skip.
